sequenceDiagram
 participant A as Web or SMS adapter
 participant O as Order Management
 participant C as Customers and Access
 participant P as Product Catalog
 participant R as Order Repository
 A->>O: SubmitOrder
 O->>C: Authenticate and check blacklist
 C-->>O: Customer identity and address
 opt Blueprint selected
 O->>R: Load blueprint and verify customer ownership
 R-->>O: Blueprint order lines
 end
 O->>P: Resolve product codes and current prices
 P-->>O: Validated products and prices
 O->>R: Save order and submission key then commit
 R-->>O: Committed order number
 O-->>A: OrderAccepted
